#
# config-hostapd-mbedtls.config - wifi-hostapd-sae lane (task-148).
#
# APPENDED to the shared OpenWrt release-line .config before "make defconfig".
# Replaces the wifi-image-integration hostapd-mini selection with the
# SAE-capable hostapd full variant (mbedtls TLS backend), whose OpenWrt package
# Makefile adds CONFIG_SAE=y + CONFIG_TLS=mbedtls on the build command line.
# At the time of this lane the bench-image baseline .config already selects
# libmbedtls=y (libmbedtls21 3.6.8-r1, part of the image), so the swap adds no
# new library package to the image: only hostapd itself changes.
#
# The image bake also uses the wifi-image-integration delta; its
# "CONFIG_PACKAGE_hostapd-mini=y" line is replaced by this file's selection
# (tools/bake-image-with-hostapd-sae.sh does the replacement and fails if both
# variants end up selected).
CONFIG_PACKAGE_hostapd-mbedtls=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_hostapd-common=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_ucode-mod-nl80211=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_ucode-mod-rtnl=y
